# Platform routes

- Canonical paths: [contracts/platform-routes.md](../../contracts/platform-routes.md)
- Not public www/player — do not add to [public-routes.md](../../contracts/public-routes.md)
- Routes: `PageCanvas` → `AppContentContainer` (segment layout) → `components/screens/platform/*Screen`
- No feature UI in `app/(platform)/**` page files
- URL locale: exempt per `lib/i18n/routing.ts` (`LOCALE_EXEMPT_PATH_PREFIXES`); UI copy still via `t("app.*")`
- Nav: `lib/app-nav-config.ts` (`companyNavItems`, `reviewerNavItems`, `bdnNavItems` on `/bdn/**`)
- Design system: `app/(platform)/bdn/designsystem/**` — no `PageCanvas`; showcases ESLint-exempt
- Also [layout-shell-page-canvas.md](../../contracts/layout-shell-page-canvas.md), [i18n-locales.md](../../contracts/i18n-locales.md)
